@page "/self-help"

<PageTitle>Cognia | Self-Help Hub</PageTitle>

<div class="selfhelp-shell">
    <header class="page-header">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Support resources</p>
            <h1>Self-Help Hub</h1>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="quick-steps" aria-label="Quick wellbeing actions">
        <article class="step-card">
            <span aria-hidden="true">🧘</span>
            <h2>Breathing break</h2>
            <p>Try a 5-minute breathing exercise to slow your thoughts and reset focus.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step-card">
            <span aria-hidden="true">📵</span>
            <h2>Digital detox</h2>
            <p>Take one low-stimulation hour to reduce overwhelm and support better rest.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step-card">
            <span aria-hidden="true">📝</span>
            <h2>Reflection note</h2>
            <p>Write down one trigger, one strength, and one next step to regain balance.</p>
        </article>
    </section>

    <section class="articles-grid">
        <article class="article-card">
            <span class="tag">Stress</span>
            <h2>Managing academic pressure</h2>
            <p>Practical strategies for reducing overwhelm, protecting your energy, and focusing on what matters most.</p>
            <button class="link-button" type="button">Read article</button>
        </article>

        <article class="article-card">
            <span class="tag">Sleep</span>
            <h2>Building a calmer bedtime routine</h2>
            <p>Create a healthier evening rhythm that helps your mind and body settle before sleep.</p>
            <button class="link-button" type="button">Read article</button>
        </article>

        <article class="article-card">
            <span class="tag">Focus</span>
            <h2>Small steps for emotional regulation</h2>
            <p>Simple daily practices to respond to stressful moments with more patience and clarity.</p>
            <button class="link-button" type="button">Read article</button>
        </article>
    </section>
</div>

<style>
    .selfhelp-shell {
        padding: 2rem;
        color: #1f2937;
    }

    .page-header {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .eyebrow {
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #0f766e;
    }

    h1, h2, p {
        margin-top: 0;
    }

    .quick-steps,
    .articles-grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    }

    .step-card,
    .article-card {
        background: white;
        border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 1.25rem;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.03);
    }

    .step-card span {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 52px;
        height: 52px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: #ecfeff;
        font-size: 1.7rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }

    .tag {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #ecfeff;
        color: #0f766e;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0.35rem 0.7rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    }

    .link-button {
        margin-top: 0.9rem;
        border: none;
        background: transparent;
        color: #4f46e5;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
        padding: 0;
    }

    .article-card p,
    .step-card p {
        color: #4b5563;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    @@media (max-width: 640px) {
        .selfhelp-shell {
            padding: 1rem;
        }
    }
</style>
